                                                                <div class="et_pb_text_inner">
                                                                    <h2><span>Introduction: </span></h2>
                                                                    <p><span>Planning a site office, labour accommodation or a temporary workspace in Qatar? The first question is almost always the price. Portable cabin prices in Qatar vary widely with size, type, materials and fittings, so a single fixed price rarely tells the full story. This guide gives you indicative starting prices for the cabin types we build most often, explains what pushes the cost up or down, and shows you how to get an exact quote for your project.</span></p>
                                                                </div>
