                                                                <div class="et_pb_text_inner">
                                                                    <h2><span>Portable Cabin Prices in Qatar (Indicative)</span></h2>
                                                                    <p><span>The table below lists indicative starting prices from our online price calculator. These are starting points for a standard specification; the final price depends on the size, materials, fittings and delivery location.</span></p>
                                                                    <table class="price-table">
                                                                        <thead>
                                                                            <tr><th>Cabin Type</th><th>Size</th><th>Indicative Price (QAR)</th></tr>
                                                                        </thead>
                                                                        <tbody>
                                                                            <tr><td>Office Cabin - Standard</td><td>3M x 6M</td><td>8,000</td></tr>
                                                                            <tr><td>Office Cabin - Large</td><td>3.75M x 7M</td><td>14,000</td></tr>
                                                                            <tr><td>Accommodation Cabin - Single</td><td>3M x 9M</td><td>20,000</td></tr>
                                                                            <tr><td>Accommodation Cabin - Double</td><td>3.75M x 9M</td><td>28,000</td></tr>
                                                                            <tr><td>Toilet / Bathroom Cabin</td><td>2.4M x 4.8M</td><td>12,000</td></tr>
                                                                            <tr><td>Container Office (20ft Conversion)</td><td>20ft</td><td>35,000</td></tr>
                                                                            <tr><td>Container Office (40ft Conversion)</td><td>40ft</td><td>55,000</td></tr>
                                                                            <tr><td>Security / Guard Cabin</td><td>2M x 3M</td><td>22,000</td></tr>
                                                                            <tr><td>Labour Accommodation Block (10 Rooms)</td><td>10 rooms</td><td>60,000</td></tr>
                                                                        </tbody>
                                                                    </table>
                                                                    <p class="price-note"><span>Prices are indicative only. For an exact price for your specification, use the <a href="/#price-calculator">Porta Cabin Price Calculator</a> on our homepage or <a href="/contact">request a quote</a>.</span></p>
