                                                                    <h2><span>What Affects the Price of a Portable Cabin?</span></h2>
                                                                    <p><span><strong>Size:</strong> larger cabins need more steel, panels and insulation, so the price rises with floor area. A standard 3M x 6M office cabin is the most economical starting point, while double-size accommodation units cost more.</span></p>
                                                                    <p><span><strong>Type and use:</strong> a basic guard cabin and a fully fitted accommodation cabin are built very differently. Toilet and bathroom cabins need plumbing and waterproofing, and container office conversions need cutting, framing and finishing work.</span></p>
                                                                    <p><span><strong>Materials and insulation:</strong> Qatar's heat and dust put real demands on a cabin. Better insulation, roofing and finishes cost more upfront but keep the cabin comfortable and durable for years.</span></p>
                                                                    <p><span><strong>Customization:</strong> partitions, windows, doors, electrical fittings, air conditioning, branding and special layouts all add to the cost. Tell us what you need and we will price the exact specification.</span></p>
                                                                    <p><span><strong>Delivery and installation:</strong> transport to your site and on-site installation depend on location and access. We deliver and install across Qatar.</span></p>
                                                                    <p><span><strong>Quantity:</strong> larger orders, such as labour camp blocks, are priced per project. Talk to us early if you need many units and we will work out the best per-unit price.</span></p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
                                                                <div class="et_pb_text_inner">
                                                                    <h2><span>How to Get an Exact Quote</span></h2>
                                                                    <p><span>Three steps: first, try the <a href="/#price-calculator">Porta Cabin Price Calculator</a> on our homepage for an instant estimate. Then, have a look at the cabin types in detail on our <a href="/portable-office-cabins">portable office cabins</a>, <a href="/labor-camps-accommodation">labour camps accommodation</a> and <a href="/container-office-cabins">container office cabins</a> pages. Finally, <a href="/contact">contact us</a> or call <a href="tel:+97450307568">+974 50307568</a> with your size, quantity and site location, and we will send you a firm quote. We have been manufacturing porta cabins in Qatar since 2009, so the quote you get is based on real build experience, not a guess.</span></p>
                                                                </div>
